sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Authorized caller
    participant Backend as Trusted backend
    participant Token as Runtime token service
    participant Shadow as Shadow HTTP service
    Caller->>Backend: Request device operation
    Backend->>Backend: Verify caller and target device authority
    alt Authorized trusted orchestration
        Backend->>Token: HTTPS POST /request_token (admin Bearer, scope=app, devid, aws_iot_data=true)
        Token-->>Backend: 200 scoped token and SigV4 bundle, or error
        opt Usable bundle returned
            Backend->>Shadow: SigV4 GET /things/device-1/shadow?name=tutorial
            Shadow-->>Backend: 200 current state and version, or 404
            Backend->>Shadow: SigV4 POST /things/device-1/shadow?name=tutorial (desired, version)
            alt Version matches
                Shadow-->>Backend: 200 accepted mutation
                Note over Backend: Device completion still requires reported-state observation
            else Version conflict
                Shadow-->>Backend: 409
                Note over Backend: GET and reconcile intent before retry
            end
        end
    else Caller unauthorized
        Backend-->>Caller: Access denied, no token request
    end
